  "cues": [
    {
      "start": 7.38,
      "end": 8.84,
      "text": "walked arm in arm,",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 10.32,
      "end": 12.02,
      "text": "I didn't feel his touch.",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 14.44,
      "end": 17.1,
      "text": "desire I'd first tried to hide,",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 17.86,
      "end": 20.4,
      "text": "that tingling inside was gone.",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 24.28,
      "end": 26.16,
      "text": "And when he asked me,",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 26.92,
      "end": 28.1,
      "text": "do you still love me?",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 28.74,
      "end": 30.02,
      "text": "I had to look away.",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 32.48,
      "end": 34.56,
      "text": "didn't want to tell him",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 36.04,
      "end": 38.82,
      "text": "my heart was colder with each day",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 38.82,
      "end": 41.36,
      "text": "when you",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 43.1,
      "end": 47.42,
      "text": "That's where the thrill is going",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 47.42,
      "end": 51.8,
      "text": "And your kisses and I",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 51.8,
      "end": 55.04,
      "text": "are replaced with tears",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 56.55,
      "end": 61.32,
      "text": "When you're dreams are on I'm trained",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 61.32,
      "end": 66.08,
      "text": "to train right now Then I",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 66.08,
      "end": 68.3,
      "text": "ask you now,",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 68.8,
      "end": 71.32,
      "text": "what's there going to do?",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 74.9,
      "end": 77.4,
      "text": "He said he'd take me away.",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 79.68,
      "end": 84.04,
      "text": "We would work things out and I didn't want to tell him",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 86.5,
      "end": 89.3,
      "text": "it was then that I had to say,",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 91.86,
      "end": 94.44,
      "text": "over the times we shared,",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 96.2,
      "end": 98.72,
      "text": "it's all blackened out.",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 100.52,
      "end": 105.08,
      "text": "My back -lightening heart wants to fly",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 105.08,
      "end": 105.6,
      "text": "away.",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 110.78,
      "end": 115.42,
      "text": "you've lost so long that the",
      "speaker": "night-road-voice",
      "intensity": 0.85
    },
    {
      "start": 115.42,
